  "licensingReminders": [
    "Valid ASOC (Restricted or General) issued by DoT/WPC is required before operating.",
    "Identify with your callsign at least every 15 minutes and at end of contact.",
    "SACFA site clearance may be required for certain locations and antenna installations.",
    "Maintain a station log and accurate frequency measuring equipment at the station.",
    "All operation is subject to the Radio Regulations and applicable Indian telecom rules."
